{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>天文台在上午11時15分發出寒冷天氣警告。天文台預測本港今明兩日（20日及21日）天氣寒冷。天文台表示，正午時分，本港普遍地區氣溫下降至約12°C。</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"（天文台）\" src=\"https://fs.mingpao.com/ins/20261120/s00024/6d104fc8fd8044de8aa9dc15ca685ced.png\">\n</p>\n<p>本港地區下午及今晚天氣預測：天氣轉冷，密雲，有幾陣雨。吹清勁北至東北風，離岸及高地吹強風。展望明早氣溫仍然偏低，日間部分時間有陽光。隨後一兩日雲量增多，風勢頗大，氣溫略為回升。（天文台）</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"（天文台）\" src=\"https://fs.mingpao.com/ins/20261120/s00024/caae2c65dcc0435d9063711629338cf0.png\">\n</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T04:43:54.237344+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":168,"images":2,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T03:57:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T06:17:36.476802+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T04:37:26.866329+00:00","content_hash":"37b1d4ec703ebf64a90911db28f2bf6dc30b5c208782f8b569795509bf3878de","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}